WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.608 --> 00:00:05.711
Mr. Wig came home from his morning walk.

2
00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:18.042
He went into his kitchen and poured some orange juice.

3
00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:33.705
Suddenly he heard sounds in his bedroom.

4
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:36.285
Click, click, click.

5
00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:38.046
Buzz, buzz.

6
00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:41.347
"What is going on in there?"

7
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:42.647
Mr. Wig wondered.

8
00:00:45.228 --> 00:00:47.688
He went into his bedroom and gasped.

9
00:00:48.969 --> 00:00:50.249
Spider webs were everywhere.

10
00:00:51.189 --> 00:00:54.190
The door to his safe was open, and the safe was empty.

11
00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.111
"Oh no!"

12
00:00:56.491 --> 00:00:56.991
cried Mr.

13
00:00:57.031 --> 00:01:00.172
Wig. "All my money is gone!"

14
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.062
"No, thank you," said a woman.

15
00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:08.484
"I don't want to buy any candy bars."

16
00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:10.706
The woman shut the door.

17
00:01:12.247 --> 00:01:14.208
Roxy and her friends were selling candy bars.

18
00:01:14.229 --> 00:01:16.690
"Oh well," said Mara.

19
00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:29.520
"Let's try the next They were raising money to help poor families in Metro City.

20
00:01:30.988 --> 00:01:32.809
The four friends arrived at the next house.

21
00:01:34.509 --> 00:01:35.610
Roxy knocked on the door.

22
00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:39.251
An old man answered.

23
00:01:39.271 --> 00:01:40.992
"Yes?" he said.

24
00:01:41.012 --> 00:01:42.693
"Hello, sir!"

25
00:01:42.993 --> 00:01:43.633
said Roxy.

26
00:01:43.653 --> 00:01:46.934
"Would you like to buy a delicious candy bar?

27
00:01:47.815 --> 00:01:48.975
We have three kinds.

28
00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:54.157
All of the money will go to—" "Candy bars rot your teeth," the man said.

29
00:01:54.177 --> 00:01:55.898
"I never eat them."

30
00:01:55.918 --> 00:02:00.400
"But we're raising money to help poor families," said Mara.

31
00:02:01.408 --> 00:02:02.489
The man shook his head.

32
00:02:02.509 --> 00:02:04.189
"I'm not interested.

33
00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.430
And I'm very busy.

34
00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.431
Good-bye." He closed the door.

35
00:02:09.451 --> 00:02:12.593
"This stinks!"

36
00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:15.294
said Jack as they walked away from the house.

37
00:02:18.135 --> 00:02:20.396
"Nobody wants to buy any candy bars."

38
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:22.717
"Don't worry," said Mara.

39
00:02:22.737 --> 00:02:25.278
"We just have to keep trying."

40
00:02:25.298 --> 00:02:29.680
"Maybe we should go to a different neighborhood," said Jack.

41
00:02:30.728 --> 00:02:33.409
"This is a rich neighborhood," said Roxy.

42
00:02:33.429 --> 00:02:36.730
"I'm sure someone here will buy some candy bars."

43
00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:38.970
Terrell's face lit up.

44
00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:41.851
"I have an idea," he said.

45
00:02:41.871 --> 00:02:46.692
"Let's ask Rocket Girl to help us sell the candy bars."

46
00:02:46.752 --> 00:02:47.553
Roxy laughed.

47
00:02:47.573 --> 00:02:50.213
"What can Rocket Girl do?

48
00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:53.034
She can't make people buy anything."

49
00:02:53.054 --> 00:02:55.495
"You're probably right."

50
00:02:56.235 --> 00:02:57.075
Terrell sighed.

51
00:02:57.095 --> 00:02:59.636
"Let's go to the next house."

52
00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.361
The four friends walked some more.

53
00:03:08.964 --> 00:03:11.885
When they reached the next house, Roxy's watch beeped.

54
00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.488
She stayed on the sidewalk as her friends went to the door.

55
00:03:16.508 --> 00:03:20.571
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

56
00:03:20.591 --> 00:03:22.172
"Is there a problem?"

57
00:03:23.273 --> 00:03:24.794
"Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

58
00:03:24.814 --> 00:03:26.895
"Do you know who Mr.

59
00:03:26.935 --> 00:03:27.556
Wig is?"

60
00:03:27.576 --> 00:03:30.158
"Of course," said Roxy.

61
00:03:31.138 --> 00:03:33.660
"He's one of the richest people in Metro City.

62
00:03:34.568 --> 00:03:36.309
I'm right near his house now, actually."

63
00:03:36.329 --> 00:03:38.791
"Good," said Mayor Bloom.

64
00:03:38.811 --> 00:03:42.793
"Someone just broke into his house and stole his money."

65
00:03:44.534 --> 00:03:46.495
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

66
00:03:47.476 --> 00:03:49.157
"Rocket Girl will find the thief!"
